    {
      "text": "Dashboard section “4. Service outputs, coverage and quality” with four monthly line charts for 2019: antenatal care and deliveries in facilities (F. 4.1; institutional deliveries about 170–240, ANC 1st visits about 125–190, ANC 4th visits about 95–190), antenatal care quality tracers (F. 4.2), BCG and DTPcv doses given (F. 4.3) and BCG and measles-containing vaccine doses given (F. 4.4); vaccine doses mostly range between about 90 and 170 a month.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
